                <pb facs="0100" n="90" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv10/pg90"/>

                <head>Appendix 39</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note for the President of the Peace
                        Conference</hi></p>
                <p>The Supreme Economic Council, at its meeting held on Saturday regarding the
                    regulations for German exports, decided that a telegram, fixing the method of
                    procedure, should be drafted on Sunday last by a Committee of Technical
                    Delegates of the Associated Governments.</p>
                <p>The Committee met and prepared the annexed telegram,<anchor n="4" xml:id="d9-f1"
                    /> which was sent to Spa by Marshal Foch.</p>
                <pb facs="0101" n="91" xml:id="pg91"/>
                <p>The Economic Council considers that the question put before the Supreme War
                    Council on the same subject is now unnecessary.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-03-24"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >March</hi> 24, 1919</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
